__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
# Sandbox workspace copies. NB the layout is runs/<mode>/<run-id>/workspace,
# so the old `runs/*/workspace/` pattern never matched and LAB's skill
# scripts were being staged. We copy nothing of harvey-labs into this repo.
runs/**/workspace/
# NB: do not exclude repeat runs by name. This previously read
# `runs/guarded/runB_r*/`, added while those dirs held aborted runs; when
# they were re-run successfully the rule silently kept the evidence for the
# n=3 parity result out of the repo. Incompleteness is detected by the
# absence of metrics.json (scripts/span_report.py), not by filename.
